<v Mrs. Mattoon>Yeah.
<v Mrs. Mattoon>是的。

00:10:50.700 --> 00:11:02.980
<v Ira Glass>All right, I'll wait.
<v Ira Glass>好的，我等。

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:03.860
<v Mrs. Mattoon>Ira?
<v Mrs. Mattoon>艾拉？

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:04.350
<v Ira Glass>Yeah.
<v Ira Glass>在。

